# wear, wield, hold and remove: every place, replacing what's there, the refusals, 'wear all', and wield's skill
# messages. In the temple (3001): Decimus (10, a warrior wearing a vest, a shield, a sword and a light, with sword
# at 75% and axe at 1%), and Smokegod (an immortal, too weak for a gnarled staff, 1503). Then, each where they log
# in, to wield a broom (666, an exotic weapon: 3 x level): Delver (2, in 3129), Outlaw (18), Locksmith (30, in
# 3110) and Heroic (51). Pupil (10, in 3023) has dagger at 50%; with Pupil, a charmed fido (3062, level 0) wields a
# chessboard (9590, exotic) and a dagger (3701), which reaches the mobs' weapon skill. A second floating stone (5231)
# finds the float taken in 'wear all'; Delver tries 'get all' where nothing's left.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
